T1  - Perceptions and experiences of generative artificial intelligence training to support research for Chinese nurses: A qualitative focus group study
AU  - Tong, Ling
AU  - Niu, Yirou
AU  - Zhou, Lixue
AU  - Jin, Shuai
AU  - Wang, Yanling
AU  - Xiao, Qian
JO  - International Journal of Nursing Sciences
VL  - 12
