T1  - Prevalence and Characteristics of Generative Artificial Intelligence Policies in Vascular Surgery Journals: A Cross-Sectional Review
AU  - Shen, Fanru
AU  - Almeida, Victor F.A.
AU  - Ha, John Y.
AU  - Ozmen, Berk B.
AU  - Duraes, Eliana F.R.
JO  - Annals of Vascular Surgery
VL  - 123
